{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31711","headline":"望山 · 贾岛","name":"望山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山三十里，不见踰一旬。\n冒雨时立望，望之如朋亲。\n虬龙一掬波，洗荡千万春。\n日日雨不断，愁杀望山人。\n天事不可长，劲风来如奔。\n阴霪一以扫，浩翠写国门。\n长安百万家，家家张屏新。\n谁家最好山，我愿爲其邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}